#: alarmmanager_admin.php:50
msgid "The administration action succeeded."
msgstr "Nahomby ny hetsika fitantanana."

#: alarmmanager_admin.php:86
msgid "Administration unavailable or permission denied."
msgstr "Tsy misy ny fitantanana na tsy nahazoana alalana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:78
msgid "Choose the alarm information to send to any service. Use Combined text to arrange device details, or Use device message to start with a complete message. Email uses Subject and Message; API destinations use the field names required by the receiving service."
msgstr "Safidio ny fampahalalana fanairana halefa any amin'ny serivisy rehetra. Ampiasao ny lahatsoratra natambatra handaminana ny antsipirian'ny fitaovana, na Ampiasao ny hafatry ny fitaovana hanombohana amin'ny hafatra feno. Mampiasa Lohahevitra sy Hafatra ny mailaka; mampiasa ny anaran-tsaha takian'ny serivisy mpandray ny fiafarana API."

#: includes/admin_view.php:79
msgid "Advanced message configuration"
msgstr "Fikirakirana hafatra mandroso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:90
msgid "New endpoint"
msgstr "Teboka fiafarana vaovao"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Custom integration"
msgstr "Fampifandraisana manokana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Integration provider"
msgstr "Mpanome fampifandraisana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "API Key SID and Secret (recommended)"
msgstr "API Key SID sy Secret (atoro)"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Account SID and Auth Token"
msgstr "Account SID sy Auth Token"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Twilio credentials"
msgstr "Fahazoan-dalana Twilio"

#: includes/admin_view.php:113
msgid "Send using"
msgstr "Alefa amin'ny alalan'ny"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Event"
msgstr "Zava-nitranga"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Incident"
msgstr "Tranga"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "ServiceNow record type"
msgstr "Karazana rakitra ServiceNow"

#: includes/admin_view.php:126
msgid "Changing the record type replaces the destination table, message fields and recovery settings with its defaults. Your instance and credentials are retained."
msgstr "Ny fanovana ny karazana rakitra dia manolo ny tabilao fiafarana, ny saha hafatra ary ny fikirakirana famerenana amin'ny sanda voafaritra mialoha. Tazonina ny instance sy ny fahazoan-dalanao."

#: includes/admin_view.php:149
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Fiafarana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:154
msgid "Email settings"
msgstr "Fikirakirana mailaka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:161
msgid "Delivery uses the Cacti mail settings. Add the people who should receive these alarms."
msgstr "Mampiasa ny fikirakirana mailaka Cacti ny fanaterana. Ampio ny olona tokony handray ireo fanairana ireo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:162
msgid "Script settings"
msgstr "Fikirakirana script"

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "JSON output is sent to the script on standard input."
msgstr "Alefa any amin'ny script amin'ny fampidirana mahazatra ny vokatra JSON."

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "The executable must exist and be executable by the worker on every delivering poller. Arguments are passed directly without a shell."
msgstr "Tsy maintsy misy ary azon'ny mpiasa tanterahina ao amin'ny poller mpanatitra tsirairay ilay programa. Alefa mivantana tsy misy shell ny masontsivana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:169
msgid "WebSocket delivery is not implemented."
msgstr "Tsy mbola napetraka ny fanaterana WebSocket."

#: includes/admin_view.php:171
msgid "Advanced delivery settings"
msgstr "Fikirakirana fanaterana mandroso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:176
msgid "Connection options"
msgstr "Safidy fifandraisana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:179
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Fomba"

#: includes/admin_view.php:186
msgid "Certificate and hostname verification remain enabled. Provision the PEM file on every poller. Saved credentials are never displayed."
msgstr "Mijanona ho mavitrika ny fanamarinana taratasy fanamarinana sy anaran'ny mpampiantrano. Apetraho ny rakitra PEM ao amin'ny poller tsirairay. Tsy aseho mihitsy ny fahazoan-dalana voatahiry."

#: includes/admin_view.php:187
msgid "Other delivery options"
msgstr "Safidy fanaterana hafa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189 includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Foano"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189
msgid "Test destination saves the current settings and queues a sample alarm for this destination. Enable the destination before testing."
msgstr "Ny Andramo ny fiafarana dia mitahiry ny fikirakirana ankehitriny ary mametraka fanairana ohatra ao an-daharana ho an'ity fiafarana ity. Alefaso aloha ny fiafarana alohan'ny hitsapana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Save endpoint"
msgstr "Tehirizo ny teboka fiafarana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Test destination"
msgstr "Andramo ny fiafarana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete endpoint"
msgstr "Fafao ny teboka fiafarana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete this endpoint, its delivery settings and saved credentials"
msgstr "Fafao ity teboka fiafarana ity, ny fikirakirana fanaterana ary ny fahazoan-dalana voatahiry"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Deleting stops future delivery and removes the saved settings and credentials. Remove notification rule references and resolve queued or running deliveries first. Completed and failed delivery history is preserved."
msgstr "Ny famafana dia mampitsahatra ny fanaterana amin'ny ho avy ary manala ny fikirakirana sy ny fahazoan-dalana voatahiry. Esory aloha ny fanondroana fitsipika fampandrenesana ary vahao ny fanaterana ao an-daharana na mandeha. Tazonina ny tantaran'ny fanaterana vita sy tsy nahomby."

#: includes/admin_view.php:205
msgid "Chat and messaging"
msgstr "Resaka sy hafatra"

#: includes/admin_view.php:206
msgid "Post alarms to a Slack channel."
msgstr "Mandefa fanairana any amin'ny fantsona Slack."

#: includes/admin_view.php:207
msgid "Post alarm cards through a Teams Workflow."
msgstr "Mandefa karatra fanairana amin'ny alalan'ny Teams Workflow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:208
msgid "Send alarms from a Telegram bot."
msgstr "Mandefa fanairana avy amin'ny bot Telegram."

#: includes/admin_view.php:209
msgid "Text alarms to phone numbers."
msgstr "Mandefa hafatra an-tsoratra fanairana amin'ny laharana finday."

#: includes/admin_view.php:210
msgid "Send approved WhatsApp templates."
msgstr "Mandefa modely WhatsApp nekena."

#: includes/admin_view.php:211
msgid "Incident management"
msgstr "Fitantanana tranga"

#: includes/admin_view.php:212
msgid "Trigger and resolve PagerDuty incidents."
msgstr "Mandrehitra sy mamaha tranga PagerDuty."

#: includes/admin_view.php:213
msgid "Open and resolve ServiceNow incidents or events."
msgstr "Manokatra sy mamaha tranga na zava-nitranga ServiceNow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:214
msgid "Network management"
msgstr "Fitantanana tambajotra"

#: includes/admin_view.php:215
msgid "Send SNMPv2c or SNMPv3 traps and INFORMs."
msgstr "Mandefa fandrika SNMPv2c na SNMPv3 sy INFORM."

#: includes/admin_view.php:216
msgid "Forward RFC 5424 or RFC 3164 messages over UDP, TCP or TLS."
msgstr "Ampitao ny hafatra RFC 5424 na RFC 3164 amin'ny alalan'ny UDP, TCP na TLS."

#: includes/admin_view.php:217
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Manokana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:218
msgid "Start from an empty endpoint."
msgstr "Manomboka amin'ny teboka fiafarana banga."

#: includes/admin_view.php:219
msgid "POST alarm JSON to any HTTPS endpoint."
msgstr "Mandefa JSON fanairana amin'ny POST mankany amin'ny teboka fiafarana HTTPS rehetra."

#: includes/admin_view.php:220
msgid "Call an API with your own method, authentication and response checks."
msgstr "Antsoy ny API miaraka amin'ny fombanao, fanamarinanao ary fanaraha-maso ny valiny."

#: includes/admin_view.php:221
msgid "Run a local executable with the alarm as JSON input."
msgstr "Tanterahena programa eo an-toerana miaraka amin'ny fanairana ho fampidirana JSON."

#: includes/admin_view.php:227
msgid "Add integration"
msgstr "Ampio fampifandraisana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Choose a template. It opens as a disabled draft; nothing is sent until you enable it."
msgstr "Misafidiana modely. Misokatra ho drafitra tsy mavitrika izany; tsy misy alefa raha tsy alefanao aloha."

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Search integrations"
msgstr "Karohy fampifandraisana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:234
msgid "Blank endpoint"
msgstr "Teboka fiafarana banga"

#: includes/admin_view.php:239
msgid "No integrations match your search."
msgstr "Tsy misy fampifandraisana mifanaraka amin'ny fikarohanao."

#: includes/admin_view.php:243
msgid "SNMP trap settings"
msgstr "Fikirakirana fandrika SNMP"

#: includes/admin_view.php:259
msgid "Saved community and passphrases are encrypted and never displayed. Leave them blank to keep the saved values; entering any value replaces all saved SNMP secrets."
msgstr "Voakody ary tsy aseho mihitsy ny fiarahamonina sy ny fehezanteny voatahiry. Avelao ho banga izany hitazonana ny sanda voatahiry; ny fampidirana sanda rehetra dia manolo ny tsiambaratelo SNMP voatahiry rehetra."

#: includes/admin_view.php:260
msgid "Traps are sent as Cacti's CACTI-MIB cactiNotify with the snmptrap binary from Cacti Settings > Paths on every delivering poller. Add one destination per receiver."
msgstr "Alefa toy ny CACTI-MIB cactiNotify an'ny Cacti miaraka amin'ny programa snmptrap avy amin'ny Fikirakirana Cacti > Lalana ao amin'ny poller mpanatitra tsirairay ny fandrika. Ampio fiafarana iray isaky ny mpandray."

#: includes/admin_view.php:261
msgid "Syslog settings"
msgstr "Fikirakirana Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:269
msgid "TLS verifies the receiver certificate and hostname. Use port 6514 for TLS. UDP and TCP are unencrypted, and a UDP message is confirmed only as sent."
msgstr "Manamarina ny taratasy fanamarinana sy ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano mpandray ny TLS. Ampiasao ny seranana 6514 ho an'ny TLS. Tsy voakody ny UDP sy TCP, ary voamarina ho lasa ihany ny hafatra UDP."

#: includes/admin_view.php:278 setup.php:191
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Andro"

#: includes/admin_view.php:283
msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Faritra ora"

#: includes/admin_view.php:291
msgid "Times use the selected timezone and the alarm event time. An end time before the start runs overnight. Equal times cover the entire selected day."
msgstr "Mampiasa ny faritra ora voafantina sy ny fotoana nitrangan'ny fanairana ny fotoana. Mandeha mandritra ny alina ny ora fiafarana alohan'ny fanombohana. Mandrakotra ny andro voafantina manontolo ny ora mitovy."

#: includes/admin_view.php:332 includes/admin_view.php:521
msgid "Create a rule"
msgstr "Mamorona fitsipika"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Mavitrika"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Priority"
msgstr "Laharam-pahamehana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:334
msgid "Rule and destination"
msgstr "Fitsipika sy fiafarana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:338
msgid "Alarm Destination"
msgstr "Toerana alehan'ny fanairana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:341
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "tsy mandeha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:343
msgid "Select one or more alarm destinations. Disabled destinations do not send alarms."
msgstr "Safidio fiafarana fanairana iray na maromaro. Tsy mandefa fanairana ny fiafarana tsy mavitrika."

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Message template"
msgstr "Modely hafatra"

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Use each destination default, or customize its message for this rule. Customization starts with a copy of the destination template and does not change other rules. If several rules match the same destination, the first matching rule in priority and ID order supplies its template."
msgstr "Ampiasao ny voafaritra mialoha amin'ny fiafarana tsirairay, na amboary manokana ny hafany ho an'ity fitsipika ity. Manomboka amin'ny dika mitovy amin'ny modely fiafarana ny fanamboarana manokana ary tsy manova fitsipika hafa. Raha fitsipika maromaro no mifanaraka amin'ny fiafarana iray ihany, ny fitsipika voalohany mifanaraka araka ny filaharan'ny laharam-pahamehana sy ny ID no manome ny modeliny."

#: includes/admin_view.php:352
msgid "Custom template"
msgstr "Modely manokana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
msgid "Destination recipient"
msgstr "Mpandray ny fiafarana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
#, php-format
msgid "Recipients: %d"
msgstr "Mpandray: %d"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Customize message for this rule"
msgstr "Amboary manokana ny hafatra ho an'ity fitsipika ity"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Unchecked: Use destination default."
msgstr "Tsy voamarika: Ampiasao ny voafaritra mialoha amin'ny fiafarana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:361
msgid "Optional: add each phone number in international format, such as +15551234567. These numbers replace the destination recipient for this rule. Leave the list empty to use the destination default. Each number has its own delivery status and retries."
msgstr "Tsy voatery: ampio ny laharana finday tsirairay amin'ny endrika iraisam-pirenena, toy ny +15551234567. Manolo ny mpandray fiafarana ho an'ity fitsipika ity ireo laharana ireo. Avelao ho banga ny lisitra hampiasana ny voafaritra mialoha amin'ny fiafarana. Samy manana ny satan'ny fanaterana sy ny famerenana ny laharana tsirairay."

#: includes/admin_view.php:374
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tsy misy"

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Build device conditions using AND, OR and groups. These conditions use the current Cacti device settings and must also satisfy any alarm filters below. With no device conditions, all devices can match."
msgstr "Manamboara fepetra fitaovana amin'ny alalan'ny AND, OR ary vondrona. Mampiasa ny fikirakirana fitaovana Cacti ankehitriny ireo fepetra ireo ary tsy maintsy mahafeno ny sivana fanairana etsy ambany koa. Raha tsy misy fepetra fitaovana dia mety hifanaraka avokoa ny fitaovana rehetra."

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Match devices"
msgstr "Mampifanaraka fitaovana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"
msgstr "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Device Status"
msgstr "Satan'ny Fitaovana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Syslog"
msgstr "Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Thold"
msgstr "Thold"

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Build alarm conditions using AND, OR, NOT and groups. Alarms must also match the device conditions above."
msgstr "Manamboara fepetra fanairana amin'ny alalan'ny AND, OR, NOT ary vondrona. Tsy maintsy mifanaraka amin'ny fepetra fitaovana etsy ambony koa ny fanairana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Match alarms"
msgstr "Mampifanaraka fanairana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:395
msgid "No alarm sources detected yet. Sources appear after their first alarm."
msgstr "Tsy mbola misy loharanon'ny fanairana hita. Miseho ny loharano aorian'ny fanairana voalohany avy aminy."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "By default, matching alarms can notify at any time. Turn on a schedule to limit when this rule matches."
msgstr "Amin'ny fomba mahazatra, afaka mampandre amin'ny fotoana rehetra ny fanairana mifanaraka. Alefaso ny fandaharam-potoana mba hametra ny fotoana ifanarahan'ity fitsipika ity."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "Notification hours"
msgstr "Ora fampandrenesana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppress notifications"
msgstr "Sakano ny fampandrenesana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppressed alarms remain in history. Recovery notifications bypass acknowledgment, cooldown and duplicate suppression, but still follow notification hours and maintenance windows."
msgstr "Mijanona ao amin'ny tantara ny fanairana voasakana. Mandingana ny fanamarinana, ny fotoana fiatoana ary ny fanakanana dika mitovy ny fampandrenesana fanasitranana, saingy mbola manaraka ny ora fampandrenesana sy ny fotoana fikojakojana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:403
msgid "Set a duration to 0 to turn it off."
msgstr "Apetraho ho 0 ny faharetana hamonoana azy."

#: includes/admin_view.php:405
msgid "Rule order"
msgstr "Filaharan'ny fitsipika"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Create rule"
msgstr "Mamorona fitsipika"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Rules with equal priority run in ID order. Stopping also applies when this rule suppresses notifications."
msgstr "Mandeha araka ny filaharan'ny ID ny fitsipika mitovy laharam-pahamehana. Mihatra koa ny fijanonana rehefa manakana fampandrenesana ity fitsipika ity."

#: includes/admin_view.php:417
msgid "Configuration Backup/Restore"
msgstr "Tahiry Fiarovana/Famerenana ny Fikirakirana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Miato vetivety"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Running"
msgstr "Mandeha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "everything has been delivered"
msgstr "efa tonga avokoa ny zava-drehetra"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
#, php-format
msgid "oldest queued %s UTC"
msgstr "tranainy indrindra ao an-daharana %s UTC"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "waiting messages"
msgstr "hafatra miandry"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "Hide messages"
msgstr "Afeno ny hafatra"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "View messages"
msgstr "Jereo ny hafatra"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "Teboka fiafarana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Hafatra"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Next try"
msgstr "Andrana manaraka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441 includes/reports.php:458
msgid "Queued"
msgstr "Ao an-daharana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Tries"
msgstr "Andrana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:451
msgid "Times in UTC · first 100 shown"
msgstr "Fotoana amin'ny UTC · 100 voalohany aseho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Pause delivery"
msgstr "Ajanony vetivety ny fanaterana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Resume delivery"
msgstr "Tohizo ny fanaterana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Clear queue"
msgstr "Diovy ny laharana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:459
#, php-format
msgid "Discard all %d waiting notifications on this poller?"
msgstr "Hanafoana ny fampandrenesana miandry %d rehetra amin'ity poller ity ve?"

#: includes/admin_view.php:460
msgid "Includes retries. They stay in delivery history as failed, reason queue_cleared."
msgstr "Ahitana ny andrana famerenana. Mijanona ao amin'ny tantaran'ny fanaterana ho tsy nahomby izy ireo, antony queue_cleared."

#: includes/admin_view.php:461
msgid "Messages already sending and alarm state are kept."
msgstr "Tazonina ny hafatra efa alefa sy ny satan'ny fanairana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:462
msgid "Tip: pause delivery first during maintenance."
msgstr "Torohevitra: ajanony vetivety aloha ny fanaterana mandritra ny fikojakojana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:463
msgid "Clear queue…"
msgstr "Diovy ny laharana…"

#: includes/admin_view.php:464
msgid "Controls apply to this poller. While paused, alarms are still received and queued; Resume sends them."
msgstr "Mihatra amin'ity poller ity ny fifehezana. Raha miato vetivety, mbola raisina sy atao an-daharana ny fanairana; mandefa azy ny Tohizo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:467
msgid "View delivery results"
msgstr "Jereo ny valin'ny fanaterana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:470
msgid "Create an integration, configure its destination and credentials, test a sample alarm here, then select it directly in a rule."
msgstr "Mamorona fampifandraisana, amboary ny fiafarany sy ny fahazoan-dalany, andramo fanairana ohatra eto, avy eo safidio mivantana ao amin'ny fitsipika."

#: includes/admin_view.php:476
msgid "Configured integrations"
msgstr "Fampifandraisana voarindra"

#: includes/admin_view.php:479
msgid "No integrations yet. Choose a template above to create one."
msgstr "Tsy mbola misy fampifandraisana. Misafidiana modely etsy ambony hamoronana iray."

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Alarm Rules"
msgstr "Fitsipika Fanairana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Choose which alarms should notify, where to send them and when to pause notifications. Rules run from lowest to highest priority."
msgstr "Safidio izay fanairana tokony hampandre, aiza no handefasana azy ary rahoviana no ajanona vetivety ny fampandrenesana. Mandeha avy amin'ny laharam-pahamehana ambany indrindra mankany amin'ny avo indrindra ny fitsipika."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create an integration before saving your first rule."
msgstr "Mamorona fampifandraisana alohan'ny hitahirizana ny fitsipikao voalohany."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create integration"
msgstr "Mamorona fampifandraisana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Fafao"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Critical"
msgstr "Henjana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Fampahalalana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Major"
msgstr "Lehibe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Minor"
msgstr "Kely"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Occurrence"
msgstr "Fisehoana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Raised"
msgstr "Nisondrotra"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Recovered"
msgstr "Sitrana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Reminder"
msgstr "Fampahatsiahivana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Updated"
msgstr "Nohavaozina"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Fampitandremana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:520
msgid "Alarm notifications require an enabled matching Alarm Rule. Without one, alarms remain in history but no notifications are sent."
msgstr "Mitaky Fitsipika Fanairana mavitrika mifanaraka ny fampandrenesana fanairana. Raha tsy misy izany dia mijanona ao amin'ny tantara ny fanairana fa tsy misy fampandrenesana alefa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:524
msgid "No rules yet. Create a rule below to start routing alarms to your notification destinations."
msgstr "Tsy mbola misy fitsipika. Mamorona fitsipika etsy ambany hanombohana ny fandefasana fanairana mankany amin'ny fiafarana fampandrenesanao."

#: includes/admin_view.php:533
msgid "Credential values are never loaded into this page. Saving replaces the endpoint record; blank values do not preserve an old password. Use the CLI for protected backup/restore and poller provisioning."
msgstr "Tsy ampidirina amin'ity pejy ity mihitsy ny sandan'ny fahazoan-dalana. Ny fitahirizana dia manolo ny rakitra teboka fiafarana; tsy mitazona tenimiafina taloha ny sanda banga. Ampiasao ny CLI ho an'ny tahiry fiarovana/famerenana voaaro sy ny fametrahana poller."

#: includes/admin_view.php:536
msgid "Create endpoint"
msgstr "Mamorona teboka fiafarana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:536
msgid "No REST API or webhook endpoints have been saved. Create an endpoint to enter its bearer token, Basic authentication username and password, or API-key headers."
msgstr "Tsy misy teboka fiafarana REST API na webhook voatahiry. Mamorona teboka fiafarana hampidirana ny bearer token, anaran'ny mpampiasa sy tenimiafina Basic authentication, na loha-hafatra lakile API."

#: includes/admin_view.php:540
